{"schema":"asx.scenario.v2","id":"sync-barrier-reusable-second-generation-001","description":"A 2-party barrier is used twice. Both tasks trip it at time 0; t.a then reaches it again at 100 and t.b only at 200. The second round is a new generation that starts empty: t.a's second wait stays parked until t.b arrives at 200, and both then pass together. A barrier that did not reset its arrival count would release t.a at 100.","unit":"sync","rules":["inv.determinism.replayable"],"seed":42,"lab":{"max_steps":1000},"regions":[{"name":"r.main","parent":"root","budget":null}],"channels":[],"sync":[{"name":"b","type":"barrier","parties":2}],"tasks":[{"name":"t.a","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"barrier_wait","barrier":"b"},{"op":"trace","message":"a round 1"},{"op":"sleep","ns":100},{"op":"barrier_wait","barrier":"b"},{"op":"trace","message":"a round 2"}]},{"name":"t.b","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"barrier_wait","barrier":"b"},{"op":"trace","message":"b round 1"},{"op":"sleep","ns":200},{"op":"trace","message":"b arrives for round 2"},{"op":"barrier_wait","barrier":"b"},{"op":"trace","message":"b round 2"}]}],"script":[],"expect":{"kind":"ok"}}
